## Why This Is Asked
Assesses cross-process security, proper use of MediaDrm, and integration with Android Keystore under realistic app constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-process isolation (android:process, android:isolatedProcess)
- AIDL IPC with minimal surface exposure
- MediaDrm session lifecycle and key management
- Hardware-backed Keystore key wrapping and envelope encryption

