## Follow-up Questions
- How would you validate no keystrokes or keys leak across process restarts?
- Which failure modes require immediate UI fallback and how would you measure them?

## Why This Question Is Asked

Tests the ability to architect cross-process plugins with strong privacy guarantees and reason about real-time constraints on Android.

## Key Concepts

- Android isolated processes and AIDL for secure IPC
- In-memory cryptography with Android Keystore integration
- Streaming frame data with backpressure-controlled ring buffers
- Plugin lifecycle management, module signing, and dynamic loading
- Performance benchmarking and security validation strategies

