## Why This Is Asked
Tests cross-process, offline-first syncing, and conflict resolution at scale in Android apps, mirroring enterprise chat/presence needs.

## Key Concepts
- Isolated processes and AIDL IPC
- Encrypted Room storage (SQLCipher)
- CRDTs (OR-Set) for multi-device merges
- TLS WebSocket with backoff and per-device tokens
- Privacy controls and key rotation

## Code Example
```aidl
// IPresenceService.aidl
package com.example.presence;

interface IPresenceService {
  void joinRoom(String roomId, String userId);
  void leaveRoom(String roomId, String userId);
  void updatePresence(String roomId, String userId, PresenceState state);
  java.util.List<PresenceEvent> getLocalEvents();
}
```

```kotlin
// CRDT and event model (simplified)
data class PresenceState(val online: Boolean, val lastActive: Long)
