// IExtensionAidl.aidl
interface IExtension {
  void initialize(in String configJson);
  java.util.List<String> getCapabilities();
  void reportEvent(in String eventJson);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle plugin upgrades and rollback without host downtime?
- How would you sandbox and revoke a misbehaving extension at runtime?

## Why This Is Asked
Assesses data layer with Room, background work with WorkManager, and simple conflict resolution. It also checks testing strategy for persistence and workers.

## Key Concepts
- Room: entities, DAO, upsert, queries
- WorkManager: constraints, backoff, retries
- Sync logic: last_modified dedup, restart resilience
- Testing: Dao tests, Worker tests, integration hints

